      This page previously presented a deployment-time review integration. The
      public portfolio now uses repository-local website validation and curated
      case-study artifacts instead.
    </p>
    <p>
      The change keeps the useful lesson—deterministic evidence before agent
      action—without publishing a consumer contract, profile, schema, routing
      policy, or runtime composition.
    </p>
